2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Slayblade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your Slayblade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bet your lunch money on your Slayblade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 60+ parts  for your Slayblade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the law with your Slayblade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a miniature PS1 city with your Slayblade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the city from a rich loser with your Slayblade</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117730/extras/94db2e31340b6b5586311f5fdd63e7f5.poster.avif?t=1787260027\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117730/extras/94db2e31340b6b5586311f5fdd63e7f5.webm?t=1787260027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117730/extras/94db2e31340b6b5586311f5fdd63e7f5.mp4?t=1787260027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ What Slayblade IS:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A snappy  experience: Colourful lo-fi visuals, simple/satisfying battles, and fun customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive gameplay mechanics: The whole game can be played with a Mouse and left-click.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2000s vibes: Battling 'blades on the street corner, hand-drawn character art, and amazing music!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of replay value: Over 60+ Blade Parts to collect, and Loads more Unlockables.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❌ What Slayblade is NOT:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No big story mode, just a brief intro+Outro cutscene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a multiplayer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you read this far, and you leave a Steam review, somehow use the word &quot;<strong>Crumpet</strong>&quot;. People will be so confused.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1080 GTX<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 4070 TI<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation"],"developers":["Henry's House, Oscar Brittain"],"publishers":["Henry's House"],"release_date":"Aug 20, 2026"}